  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Corrections release. 2.0.0 shipped documentation that did not compile and a\n\t\t\tschema that was missing columns:\n\t\t\t- AddCoreIdempotencyPostgreSql was documented as parameterless, but it requires\n\t\t\t  a configuration delegate.\n\t\t\tThe provider never created its schema. The documented idempotency_keys table\n\t\t\t  predated the lease contract, omitting state and lease_id, and failed on the\n\t\t\t  first request.\n\t\t\tThe package now ships scripts/postgres.sql so consumers can create the table.\n\t\t\tAlso: XML documentation is published, SourceLink is enabled, and the package\n\t\t\tmetadata URLs were corrected.",
